# impeccable design-review scratch (reference images, critique snapshots).
# The DESIGN.md sidecar is part of the design record and IS tracked.
# Globbed rather than anchored: a pattern containing a slash is relative to this
# file, so the un-globbed form ignored the repo root's copy and silently tracked
# `clients/web/.impeccable/`.
**/.impeccable/*
!**/.impeccable/design.json
